# Weekly Offers

The homepage **THE OFFER THIS WEEK** rotates every Sunday (America/New_York) from `epochSunday` in `public/data/offers.json`.

## Automatic selection (default)

`lib/offers.js` resolves each week without manual work:

1. **Curated override** in `public/data/offers.json` `offers[]` (if present for that week)
2. Else next unused single-player **Call** from `pipelineArticle` (default `2026-big-calls`)
3. Else next unused live-board edge (BUY / ADP gap, else Elite by overall rank)

History is derived the same way — do not require a hand-written entry for every past week.

## Agent behavior

- Do **not** ask the user who the offer of the week should be. Resolve it with `getCurrentOffer()` / `resolveOfferForWeek()`.
- Only write a curated `offers.json` entry when the user wants polished custom copy, or when fixing a bad auto pick.
- When adding a curated entry, keep `week`, `player`, `position`, `team`, `blurb`, `body`, `articleSlug`.
- Never reuse a player already used in an earlier offer week.
- Week 1 = Herbert (curated). New Sundays advance the calendar week automatically; no code change required for the rollover itself.
